    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20904" root="سنح" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنِيحٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَانِحٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>Pearls;</i> or <i>large
pearls;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُرٌّ</span>: (O, K:) or (K, but accord. to
the O, “ also ”) the <i>string upon which they are
to be strung, before they are strung thereon:</i> (O,
K:) when they have been strung, it is termed
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِقْدٌ</span>: (O:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُنُحٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And [<i>Ornaments
such as are termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُلِىّ</span>. (O, K.)

